					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "EXAMPLE 2: FLOAT TO TEXTURE\n\nIn this example we are converting floats to textures with the Texture from Data node.\nThis gives us the Texture2Dchannel type, a single channel of video, to be used as red, green, blue of alpha in the texture node.\nThe Float4 node would be much more effective here, so make sure to check that one out."
					}
				},
