					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "EXAMPLE 1 : CONVERSION\n\nIn this example we are converting Integers, Booleans and Strings to Float.\n\nWhen you connect a String to the Float node and it will try to convert it to a Float. \nWhen you type in \"Porsche 9.11\" it will obviously not succeed and return the default value instead. \nBut when you enter \"9.11\" it will work just fine."
					}
				},
